<description>&lt;p&gt;Separatist leader Lucas Ayaba pleaded not guilty at a war-crimes trial in Norway, while Boko Haram insurgents have resurfaced in northern Cameroon. In the Anglophone regions, ex-rebels remain hidden and report broken promises from the government. In a remote national park, elephants killed a Swiss tourist and injured a British and an American hiker, prompting other hikers to hide in tree stumps. The conflict recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNeWpNNmgtX0w0RzVaTjFRTVVCWlEyek90cm1Pa0J3V1BJRVpzQ2o0SXhib2ZlbEtPcUtFaF9DU0JqYkxBY2o5ZDI4X0xTNklZR2hDSXlSZXN5RzZRUmZwcEk2VUU3aHdHckVjY2M0S1Y3UHlPZFVPVDdaMk55ekgwV3BXRU9YV3dXcjliVjhKS0FETkpP?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQbUg3X2xpLW9XQ3NPMFZVSC11Vm1hWXliNUtnb1VVNV96S0JpMDN1UDl0UGJPN3JPWF83c1lNNE51WDROdm50LXBsWm1ScjhKS05rSHJhbEY4dk02ZDNkWno2alZucEs0TWtKcUNkZVN0by1mZlhqQ3RUaURISHpEN21JeFI2a1VZSkV2OXV1YXpmeUN3bTlTUWU1eW1mUGZCVWE4S25OTndKNlRwY1BiaFBSdmI0M1BPUmlmVWp3Mk95dV9WYUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nacionale&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPUWpVcC1VZ19xYkdvdHpGRlZPMV9YMmtKdjV0d1VBTTFhbHNQbVF2eS02NmY3bUNFVHo4SjlWclVKVzRzeWlVRzE5T3I3cGJIRl9oZnVTMTltSjlfOVdBWWJXYWhzcFJHTkxORTg4YjZESTVYQlRaLVBTN2VNTU1jajFhcTlXUEc4c2FSUTFfOU9ISXJSUWhVMllsTmJKV09TRTRWUVI1dW1jQmRHRzF6RFRELVlkWnpLeUZReFFNU0c0b2hHQVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Geo News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Українські Національні Новини (УНН)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOdE4tZ0hJQkxmNGUtc0RtZ0dHcHlsMVJSa